<p>Hum Anjuman e Asghari hai shah ke azadaar <br />
Maatam ke liye rehte hain har haal me tayyar</p>

<p>1. Mazloom Hussaina ki sada rehti hai lab par<br />
Karte hain sada matame Abbas(a.s) e alamdaar<br />
Maatam ke liye rehte hain har haal me tayyar</p>

<p>2.Shabbir(a.s) ki nusrat ke liye jaan bhi denge<br />
Hum karte hain khoo'n apna bahaakar yahi izhaar<br />
Maatam ke liye rehte hain har haal me tayyar</p>

<p>3. Ashk e Ghame Hussian(a.s) hain aankhoo'n me hamaare<br />
Deti hai duayei'n hamei'n zehra(s.a) jigar figaar<br />
Maatam ke liye rehte hain har haal me tayyar</p>

<p>4. Hoti hai har ek ghar me bapa majlis e sarwar<br />
poora hua armaane dile Zainab(s.a) nachaar<br />
Maatam ke liye rehte hain har haal me tayyar</p>

<p>5. Azmat ghame shabbir(a.s) ki duniya ko bata do<br />
Rota hai jo is gham me wo jannat ka hai haqdaar<br />
Maatam ke liye rehte hain har haal me tayyar</p>

<p>6. Aa sakti nahi is pa musibat koi <b>Haider</b><br />
Abbas(a.s) ke parcham tale rehta hai jo gham khwaar<br />
Maatam ke liye rehte hain har haal me tayyar</p>

